        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 26,
        "headingId": 766,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2C32.Y &amp; XH5VK4 Other specified basal cell carcinoma of skin &amp; Infiltrating basal cell carcinoma, NOS</p>\r\n",
